Dear List

I just tried the newest Sarge d-i (20050603) on a AlphaServer 4100 with
a Qlogic ISP 1020 and I'm getting an
  Unable to handle kernel paging request at virtual address
  0000000000000240
  kernel panic: Aiee, killing interrupt handler

This happens while formatting a RAID5 array with ext3 FS (during
syncing). It seems to be related to Bug #298136.

Should I report this as a additional note to the existing bug or file a
new bug against d-i? Is this important, normal, severe or superflous?

Regards, Adrian.



