You need a BusID line in your X11 configuration file.  Here is what I  
use in my 164LX:

Section "Device"
         Identifier      "Accelgraphics Inc. AccelStar II"
         Driver          "glint"
         VideoRam        8192
         BusID           "PCI:0:9:0"
EndSection

 From your log information, it looks like you need to set the BusID to  
0:5:0.

Bob

